      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine ground cumin, ground coriander, salt, sugar, chili powder, ground ginger, ground cinnamon, black pepper, and ground cloves in a small bowl; set aside. Slice lemon into 8 wedges; set aside. Brush corn with olive oil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Grill corn on the preheated grill, flipping every few minutes, until lightly browned, about 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
